== Places of Interest ==

=== Blackjack Dealer ===
In the bottom left house is Gambler Dirk who will play blackjack with the player with a bet of ₽1,000. If the player wins 5 times then the game chances to high stakes betting, where the player can choose an amount to bet, but the amount paid is multiplied by the difference in card value at the end of the game.

